%SIXMD 1
# @?DXRINFO - DISPLAY A DAIMOS DXR V1 HEADER

## DESCRIPTION

PRINTS ENTRY, IMAGE, BSS, AND RELOCATION HEADER INFORMATION FOR A DXR V1 IMAGE.

USAGE IS 'DXRINFO FILE'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/DXRINFO
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/DXRINFO.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

